value.proposal:
Restore LAN parity in the controller:
- validate cliente with the LAN regex and return Ok("El cliente es incorrecto");
- return Ok("No tiene facturas") on an empty list;
- return one object shaped like SaldoFactura (or change the DMZ to parse a JArray);
- filter or verify by cliente.
The body mapping depends on the open decision C07.

